#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Use decorators from ``maxframe.udf`` when a UDF needs more memory, third-"
"party Python packages, or access to OSS files. When multiple UDFs need the "
"same resources, image, or network whitelists, set defaults with "
"``maxframe.config.options``. Complete decorator signatures and parameter "
"definitions are in the :doc:`UDF API reference <../../reference/udf>`."
msgstr ""
"UDF 需要更多内存、第三方 Python 包或访问 OSS 文件时，可以使用 ``maxframe.udf`` 中的装饰器。多个 UDF "
"使用相同的资源、镜像或网络白名单时，可以通过 ``maxframe.config.options`` 设置共享默认值。装饰器的完整签名和参数定义见 "
":doc:`UDF API 参考 <../../reference/udf>`。"

