#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:65
msgid ""
"Shared names in this table omit the ``options.`` prefix. "
"``with_resource_libraries`` is an alias of ``with_resources``. Mounts, "
"network settings, and custom images do not select DPE automatically; the "
"examples below select it explicitly. GPU tasks need an available quota. For "
"elastic-memory requirements, see :ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory`."
msgstr ""
"表中的共享配置省略了 ``options.`` 前缀。``with_resource_libraries`` 是 ``with_resources`` "
"的别名。挂载、网络配置和自定义镜像不会自动选择 DPE，下方示例会显式指定引擎。GPU 任务需要可用的 Quota；弹性内存的使用条件见 "
":ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:71
msgid ""
"SPE runs UDFs in one Python process. The CPU and memory settings above do "
"not resize that process. Packages and files must already be available in its"
" environment; the UDF decorators do not install or load them for SPE. "
"``python_tag`` selects the remote SPE runtime; local execution uses the "
"current Python process. Unsupported settings do not provide the "
"corresponding feature on that engine. Decorator and resource validation "
"still applies before execution, so an invalid combination can raise an error"
" even when the engine does not use the settings."
msgstr ""
"SPE 在一个 Python 进程内运行 UDF，上表中的 CPU 和内存配置不会改变该进程的资源。依赖包和文件需要已经存在于运行环境中，SPE "
"不会通过这些 UDF 装饰器安装或加载它们。``python_tag`` 用于选择远端 SPE 的运行环境，本地执行使用当前 Python "
"进程。表中的“不支持”表示对应引擎不能通过该配置提供这项功能。装饰器和资源参数仍会在执行前校验，因此即使引擎不使用某项配置，非法组合也可能先报错。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:81
msgid "Configure one user-defined function"
msgstr "单独配置一个 UDF"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:83
msgid ""
"Before passing a function that reads files or calls a service to MaxFrame, "
"declare its result type to avoid a trial call on the client. See "
":ref:`udf_result_types`."
msgstr "如果函数会读取文件或请求服务，应在传给 MaxFrame 前声明结果类型，避免客户端试调用，详见 :ref:`udf_result_types`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:92
msgid "Execution engine and resources"
msgstr "指定执行引擎和资源"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:94
msgid ""
"Use ``with_running_options`` to select an engine or adjust the resources for"
" a UDF. Both DPE and MCSQL support ``cpu`` and ``memory``. ``memory_limit``,"
" ``gu``, ``gu_type``, and ``gu_quota`` apply only to DPE, as listed in "
":ref:`udf_config_engine_support`."
msgstr ""
"``with_running_options`` 用于选择 UDF 的执行引擎或调整资源。DPE 和 MCSQL 都支持 ``cpu`` 和 "
"``memory``；``memory_limit``、``gu``、``gu_type`` 和 ``gu_quota`` 仅用于 DPE，支持范围见 "
":ref:`udf_config_engine_support`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:99
msgid ""
"DPE uses ``cpu`` and ``memory`` as resource requests for each function task."
" MCSQL applies them to UDF worker settings and also calculates compute units"
" (CU), using one CPU and 4 GiB of memory per CU. For example, ``cpu=2`` and "
"``memory=\"12GiB\"`` produce a CU setting of 3."
msgstr ""
"DPE 按 ``cpu`` 和 ``memory`` 为每个函数任务申请资源。MCSQL 会将它们用于 UDF Worker 的资源设置，并按每 CU "
"对应 1 个 CPU、4 GiB 内存换算计算资源单位（CU）。例如 ``cpu=2``、``memory=\"12GiB\"`` 对应的 CU 设置为"
" 3。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:104
msgid ""
"Integer memory values use GiB; strings can specify units, such as "
"``\"512MiB\"``. Use ``gu`` and ``gu_quota`` to request GPU units and select "
"a DPE GPU quota. For a Spot GU quota, see ``gu_type`` and ``gu_quota`` in "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_running_options`."
msgstr ""
"内存参数使用整数时，单位为 GiB；也可以用字符串指定单位，例如 ``\"512MiB\"``。``gu`` 用于申请 GPU "
"单元，``gu_quota`` 用于选择 DPE GPU Quota。Spot GU Quota 的参数见 "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_running_options` 中的 ``gu_type`` 和 ``gu_quota``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:109
msgid ""
"Use one ``with_running_options`` decorator per UDF. An outer decorator that "
"sets an engine or resource option replaces the inner engine and whole "
"resource dictionary. Fields are not merged between decorators; omitted "
"fields inherit the shared defaults. An empty decorator, or one setting only "
"``image_name``, keeps the existing engine and resources. ``gu`` or "
"``gu_type`` cannot be combined with ``cpu`` or ``memory``."
msgstr ""
"一个 UDF 使用一个 ``with_running_options`` "
"装饰器。外层装饰器只要设置了引擎或资源参数，就会替换内层的引擎和整个资源字典，不会逐项合并；未指定的字段沿用公共默认值。空装饰器，或只设置 "
"``image_name`` 的装饰器，会保留已有的引擎和资源配置。``gu`` 或 ``gu_type`` 不能与 "
"``cpu``、``memory`` 同时设置。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:116
msgid ""
"If the requested memory per CPU exceeds "
"``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio``, MaxFrame increases the "
"CPU request before submission and emits a warning."
msgstr ""
"申请的内存与 CPU 数量之比超过 ``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio`` "
"时，MaxFrame 会在提交任务前增加 CPU 数量，并给出警告。因此，任务最终申请的 CPU 可能比填写的数量多。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:120
msgid ""
"The combined example below uses ``cpu=2`` and ``memory=\"8GiB\"``. For "
"memory sizing and CPU adjustments, see :ref:`udf_tuning_resources`."
msgstr ""
"下方的组合示例使用 ``cpu=2`` 和 ``memory=\"8GiB\"``。内存大小和 CPU 联动的说明见 "
":ref:`udf_tuning_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:126
msgid "Elastic memory"
msgstr "配置弹性内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:128
msgid ""
"``memory_limit`` sets the maximum allocation for eligible DPE CPU UDF "
"retries after OOM. Set it above ``memory`` to enable expansion. See "
":ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory` for examples, shared defaults, override "
"rules, and troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"``memory_limit`` 是符合条件的 DPE CPU UDF 因 OOM 重试时的内存上限，设置为大于 ``memory`` "
"时开启扩容。示例、共享默认值、覆盖规则和排查方法见 :ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:138
msgid "Python packages"
msgstr "安装 Python 依赖"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:140
msgid ""
"If a UDF imports a package that is missing from the remote environment, add "
"it with ``with_python_requirements``. Installing the package on the client "
"does not install it in the remote environment."
msgstr ""
"UDF 用到了远程环境中没有安装的 Python 包时，可以通过 ``with_python_requirements`` "
"添加。在本地安装过的包，还需要在远程运行环境中准备好。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:144
msgid ""
"Before the function task runs, MaxFrame submits a PythonPack task, which "
"builds or reuses the remote Python package environment. A matching build has"
" the same requirement set and build options. ``prefer_binary=True`` tells "
"PythonPack to prefer binary distributions."
msgstr ""
"UDF 任务运行前，MaxFrame 会提交 PythonPack 任务，构建或复用远程 Python "
"依赖包环境。依赖要求和构建选项都相同时，可以复用已有环境。``prefer_binary=True`` 表示让 PythonPack "
"优先使用二进制分发包。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:149
msgid ""
"Available wheels also depend on the remote Python ABI. See "
":ref:`udf_config_python` for ``options.python_tag`` when diagnosing a "
"package build or wheel compatibility failure."
msgstr ""
"wheel 能否使用还取决于远程环境的 Python ABI。排查依赖包构建或 wheel 兼容性问题时，可查看 "
":ref:`udf_config_python` 中对 ``options.python_tag`` 的说明。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:158
msgid "MaxCompute resource files"
msgstr "读取 MaxCompute 资源文件"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:160
msgid ""
"Use ``with_resources`` for files such as label lists or configuration files "
"uploaded as MaxCompute resources."
msgstr "标签列表、配置文件等已经上传为 MaxCompute 资源时，可以通过 ``with_resources`` 让 UDF 读取这些文件。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:163
msgid ""
"The combined example below opens ``labels.txt`` from the function's working "
"directory. See :func:`maxframe.udf.with_resources` for resource name "
"formats."
msgstr ""
"下方的组合示例会从函数的工作目录中打开 ``labels.txt``。资源名称的格式见 "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:171
msgid "OSS files"
msgstr "挂载 OSS 文件"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:173
msgid ""
"If the function or a library reads files by local path, use "
"``with_fs_mount`` to mount an OSS path in DPE. The UDF can then read the "
"files through the mount path. MCSQL does not support these mounts; see "
":ref:`udf_config_engine_support`."
msgstr ""
"如果函数或依赖库需要按本地路径读文件，可以在 DPE 中用 ``with_fs_mount`` 挂载 OSS 路径，再通过挂载路径访问文件。MCSQL "
"不支持这种挂载，详见 :ref:`udf_config_engine_support`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:211
msgid ""
"When mounting multiple OSS paths on one UDF, use the same "
"``storage_options`` for every ``with_fs_mount`` decorator."
msgstr "同一个 UDF 挂载多个 OSS 路径时，各个 ``with_fs_mount`` 的 ``storage_options`` 必须完全一致。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:214
msgid ""
"For AccessKey authentication and the full ``storage_options`` contract, see "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount`."
msgstr "AccessKey 鉴权和 ``storage_options`` 的完整要求见 :func:`maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:222
msgid "Network access"
msgstr "访问网络服务"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:224
msgid ""
"When a UDF calls a remote service, configure network access with "
"``with_network_options``. Choose the setting for the public network, Alibaba"
" Cloud internal network, or VPC where the service is located. These settings"
" apply to DPE only; see :ref:`udf_config_engine_support`."
msgstr ""
"UDF 调用远端服务时，使用 ``with_network_options`` 配置网络访问。根据服务所在的公网、阿里云内网或 VPC "
"选择对应参数。这些配置仅适用于 DPE，支持范围见 :ref:`udf_config_engine_support`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:254
msgid ""
"Replace the placeholders with endpoints and a network-link name already "
"configured for the MaxCompute project. DPE checks these settings before "
"submitting the UDF task."
msgstr ""
"将示例中的占位内容替换为当前 MaxCompute 项目已经配置好的访问地址和 network link 名称。DPE 会在提交 UDF "
"任务前检查这些配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:258
msgid ""
"If multiple ``with_network_options`` decorators are applied, their public "
"whitelists are combined, as are their internal whitelists. A UDF can use "
"only one VPC network link."
msgstr ""
"添加多个 ``with_network_options`` 时，公网白名单会合并，内网白名单也会合并。一个 UDF 只能使用一个 VPC network"
" link。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:267
msgid "Custom images"
msgstr "使用自定义镜像"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:269
msgid ""
"Use ``with_image_options`` to run a UDF in a custom runtime image that has "
"been registered in MaxCompute. Custom UDF images require DPE; see "
":ref:`udf_config_engine_support`."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``with_image_options`` 可以让 UDF 运行在已注册到 MaxCompute 的自定义镜像中。自定义 UDF 镜像需要使用 "
"DPE，支持范围见 :ref:`udf_config_engine_support`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:287
msgid "Combine decorators"
msgstr "同时使用多种配置"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:289
msgid ""
"Multiple decorators can be combined on one UDF. For example, the following "
"UDF runs with the specified task resources, Pillow, and the ``labels.txt`` "
"resource file available:"
msgstr "一个 UDF 可以组合多个装饰器。下面同时设置任务资源、安装 Pillow，并使用 ``labels.txt`` 资源文件："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:316
msgid "Set shared defaults with ``options``"
msgstr "为多个 UDF 设置默认配置"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:318
msgid ""
"Import ``options`` and set shared values before creating the session or the "
"MaxFrame expressions that use them:"
msgstr "多个 UDF 使用相同配置时，可以统一写在 ``options`` 中。这些设置需要在创建会话和相关 MaxFrame 表达式之前完成："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:325
msgid ""
"See :ref:`udf_shared_options_reference` for the option names, types, and "
"defaults. The examples below show common settings."
msgstr "配置项名称、类型和默认值见 :ref:`udf_shared_options_reference`，下面介绍常见设置。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:331
msgid "Python runtime"
msgstr "Python 运行环境"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:337
msgid ""
"``cp311`` selects CPython 3.11; ``cp37`` selects CPython 3.7 in runtimes "
"that provide it. These are the Python tags documented for the `built-in "
"images <https://help.aliyun.com/en/maxcompute/built-in-images>`_. The SDK "
"accepts a string, but the selected runtime must provide that ABI. Check the "
"image and dependency wheels before changing it."
msgstr ""
"``cp311`` 表示 CPython 3.11；运行环境提供 CPython 3.7 时，可以使用 ``cp37``。这两个取值见 `内置镜像说明 "
"<https://help.aliyun.com/en/maxcompute/built-in-images>`_。SDK "
"接受字符串，但实际运行环境必须提供对应 ABI。修改前，应确认镜像版本和依赖包的 wheel 是否匹配。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:346
msgid "Default task resources"
msgstr "设置默认资源"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:355
msgid ""
"On DPE, each function task requests two CPUs and 8 GiB of memory by default."
" On MCSQL, these defaults configure UDF worker resources and produce a CU "
"setting of 2. The ``memory_limit`` and ``gpu`` fields apply only to DPE."
msgstr ""
"在 DPE 上，每个函数任务默认申请 2 个 CPU 和 8 GiB 内存。在 MCSQL 上，这些默认值用于 UDF Worker 的资源配置，对应的"
" CU 设置为 2。``memory_limit`` 和 ``gpu`` 仅用于 DPE。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:359
msgid ""
"The shared GPU field is named ``gpu``; the decorator parameter is ``gu``. "
"For elastic-memory defaults, see :ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory`."
msgstr ""
"共享配置中的 GPU 字段名为 ``gpu``，装饰器参数名为 ``gu``。弹性内存的默认配置见 "
":ref:`user_guide_elastic_memory`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:365
msgid "Default GPU quota and custom image"
msgstr "设置默认 GPU Quota 和自定义镜像"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:372
msgid ""
"Both defaults apply to DPE UDFs. ``gu_quota_name`` is used when a function "
"requests a GPU without setting ``gu_quota``. ``image_name`` is used when a "
"function does not set ``with_image_options``; it does not select DPE "
"automatically. MCSQL does not support either setting."
msgstr ""
"这两个默认值都用于 DPE UDF。函数申请了 GPU 但未指定 ``gu_quota`` 时，使用 ``gu_quota_name``；函数未设置 "
"``with_image_options`` 时，使用 ``image_name``，但它不会自动选择 DPE。MCSQL 不支持这两项设置。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:378
msgid "DPE network whitelists"
msgstr "设置 DPE 网络白名单"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:389
msgid ""
"Replace the placeholders with endpoints configured for the MaxCompute "
"project. DPE validates both lists before submitting function tasks. A VPC "
"network link applies to one function and is configured with "
"``with_network_options(vpc_network_link=...)``."
msgstr ""
"将示例中的占位地址替换为 MaxCompute 项目中已经配置好的 IP 地址或域名。DPE 会在提交 UDF 任务前检查这两份白名单。访问 VPC "
"服务时，需要通过 ``with_network_options(vpc_network_link=...)`` 为 UDF 单独指定 VPC "
"network link。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:397
msgid "Override a shared default for one function"
msgstr "为个别 UDF 调整配置"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:407
msgid ""
"With the shared defaults in :ref:`udf_config_default_resources`, "
"``use_more_cpu`` uses four CPUs and inherits 8 GiB of memory."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`udf_config_default_resources` 中的共享默认值时，``use_more_cpu`` 会使用 4 个 "
"CPU，并继承 8 GiB 内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:414
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:415
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "生效规则"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:416
msgid "Execution engine"
msgstr "执行引擎"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:417
msgid ""
"``engine`` explicitly selects an available engine for that function, taking "
"precedence over automatic engine selection. Without it, MaxFrame follows the"
" job's engine settings."
msgstr "``engine`` 为这个函数显式指定一个可用的引擎，优先于自动选引擎规则。没有指定时，按作业配置自动选择。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:420
msgid "CPU, memory, memory limit, or GPU"
msgstr "CPU、内存、内存上限或 GPU"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:421
msgid ""
"A field set by ``with_running_options`` replaces the corresponding field in "
"``default_running_options``. Other fields are inherited."
msgstr ""
"``with_running_options`` 中填了哪一项，就覆盖 ``default_running_options`` "
"中的对应项。没有填的项继续使用默认值。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:423
msgid "GPU quota"
msgstr "GPU Quota"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:424
msgid "``gu_quota`` replaces ``options.session.gu_quota_name`` for that function."
msgstr "优先使用装饰器中的 ``gu_quota``，未指定时使用 ``options.session.gu_quota_name``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:426
msgid "Custom image"
msgstr "自定义镜像"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:427
msgid ""
"For DPE UDFs, ``with_image_options`` replaces ``options.session.image_name``"
" for that function. Neither setting selects DPE automatically."
msgstr ""
"对 DPE UDF，``with_image_options`` 会覆盖 "
"``options.session.image_name``。这两项配置都不会自动选择 DPE。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:430
msgid "Public or internal network whitelist"
msgstr "公网或内网白名单"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:431
msgid ""
"In DPE, function-level and shared whitelists are combined separately for "
"public and internal addresses."
msgstr "在 DPE 中，函数级白名单和共用白名单会合并，公网和内网分别合并。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:434
msgid ""
"Python dependencies, MaxCompute resource files, OSS mounts, and VPC network "
"links have no shared ``options`` setting and are configured with decorators."
msgstr ""
"Python 依赖、MaxCompute 资源文件、OSS 挂载和 VPC network link 需要通过装饰器配置，没有对应的 "
"``options`` 配置项。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:440
msgid "Troubleshoot configuration problems"
msgstr "配置后遇到问题怎么办"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:446
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "遇到的问题"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:447
msgid "What to check"
msgstr "检查方法"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:448
msgid "An ``options`` setting does not take effect"
msgstr "``options`` 中的配置没有生效"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:449
msgid ""
"Check that the setting is specified before creating the session or the "
"relevant MaxFrame expressions. Then check whether a decorator overrides the "
"same setting. See :ref:`udf_config_precedence`."
msgstr ""
"先检查是否在创建会话和相关 MaxFrame 表达式之前完成了配置，再检查 UDF 的装饰器是否覆盖了同一项配置。具体规则见 "
":ref:`udf_config_precedence`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:452
msgid "The task requests more CPUs than configured"
msgstr "实际申请的 CPU 比填写的多"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:453
msgid ""
"Check the warning and ``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio``. "
"MaxFrame increases the CPU request if the memory per CPU exceeds this limit."
" CPU allocation may also increase during an elastic-memory retry. See "
":ref:`udf_config_resources`."
msgstr ""
"检查警告信息和 ``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio``。每个 CPU "
"对应的内存超过限制时，MaxFrame 会增加 CPU 请求；弹性内存重试时，CPU 也可能随内存一起增加。详见 "
":ref:`udf_config_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:457
msgid "An elastic-memory configuration fails or has no effect"
msgstr "弹性内存配置报错或不生效"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:458
msgid ""
"Check :ref:`udf_config_elastic_overrides` for inherited limits and "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_not_expanding` for engine and retry restrictions."
msgstr ""
"继承的内存上限问题见 :ref:`udf_config_elastic_overrides`；执行引擎和重试条件的限制见 "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_not_expanding`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:460
msgid "``memory must be specified when memory_limit is set``"
msgstr "``memory must be specified when memory_limit is set``"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:461
msgid ""
"The merged settings have a limit but no starting memory. Set ``memory`` in "
"the decorator or in ``options.function.default_running_options``. See "
":ref:`udf_config_elastic_overrides`."
msgstr ""
"合并后的配置只有内存上限，没有初始内存。需要在装饰器或 ``options.function.default_running_options`` 中设置"
" ``memory``，具体见 :ref:`udf_config_elastic_overrides`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:464
msgid "``gu or gu_type can't be specified with cpu or memory``"
msgstr "``gu or gu_type can't be specified with cpu or memory``"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:465
msgid ""
"A GPU request is combined with a CPU or memory request. Remove ``cpu`` and "
"``memory`` from the GPU decorator, or remove ``gu`` and ``gu_type`` to run a"
" CPU task."
msgstr ""
"GPU 配置与 CPU 或内存配置同时出现。运行 GPU 任务时，从装饰器中去掉 ``cpu`` 和 ``memory``；运行 CPU 任务时，去掉 "
"``gu`` 和 ``gu_type``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:468
msgid "``gu_type requires gu_quota to be specified``"
msgstr "``gu_type requires gu_quota to be specified``"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:469
msgid ""
"Set ``gu_quota`` in the same decorator as ``gu_type``. The shared quota "
"default does not satisfy this decorator check. See "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_running_options`."
msgstr ""
"在设置 ``gu_type`` 的同一个装饰器中指定 ``gu_quota``。仅设置公共默认 Quota 无法通过这里的校验。参数说明见 "
":func:`maxframe.udf.with_running_options`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:472
msgid "A GPU quota is configured, but the task does not request a GPU"
msgstr "设置了 GPU Quota，任务却没有申请 GPU"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:473
msgid ""
"Also specify a GPU count: use ``gu`` in ``with_running_options``, or ``gpu``"
" in ``options.function.default_running_options``. A quota name alone does "
"not request GPU resources."
msgstr ""
"还需要指定 GPU 数量：在 ``with_running_options`` 中填写 ``gu``，或在 "
"``options.function.default_running_options`` 中填写 ``gpu``。只设置 Quota 名称不会申请 "
"GPU。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:476
msgid "The UDF cannot import a package installed on the client"
msgstr "本地能导入 Python 包，UDF 运行时却报找不到模块"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:477
msgid ""
"Check whether the remote environment contains the package. Add missing "
"packages with ``with_python_requirements``, or use a registered image that "
"contains them. See :ref:`udf_config_packages`."
msgstr ""
"检查远程运行环境是否安装了这个包。缺少的包可以通过 ``with_python_requirements`` "
"添加，也可以使用已包含这些包的注册镜像，详见 :ref:`udf_config_packages`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:480
msgid "Network configuration validation fails"
msgstr "提交任务时，网络配置检查未通过"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/udf_configuration.rst:481
msgid ""
"Check that the addresses and network-link name are configured for the "
"current MaxCompute project. Public addresses need to be added to the "
"whitelist through a service ticket before use. See "
":ref:`udf_config_network`."
msgstr ""
"核对访问地址和 network link 名称是否已在当前 MaxCompute 项目中配置。公网地址需要提前提交工单加入白名单，详见 "
":ref:`udf_config_network`。"
